/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k:66:  rule cntOccVS(.ValSeq, _:Val)                => 0
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k:67:  rule cntOccVS(vCons(A:Val, R:ValSeq), V:Val) => 1 +Int cntOccVS(R, V) requires A ==K V
