/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k:112:  syntax Bool ::= isUpperC(Int) [function, total]
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k:113:  rule isUpperC(C:Int) => C >=Int 65 andBool C <=Int 90
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k:115:  syntax Bool ::= isLowerC(Int) [function, total]
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k:116:  rule isLowerC(C:Int) => C >=Int 97 andBool C <=Int 122
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k:118:  syntax Bool ::= isAlphaC(Int) [function, total]
