Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

Both submitted claims reconstruct to `#Top`, but the only full function-call proof covers the empty list. The arbitrary proof starts at an internal loop over the proof-only `intVals` representation, without a machine-checked connection to real list inputs or an arbitrary end-to-end call theorem.

Detailed findings and evidence: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md).
